      "function_name": "axiInvokeLLM",
      "description": "Invoke the LLM integration directly. Use this for text generation, analysis, summarization, structured data extraction, or web-augmented research. Params: { prompt (required), add_context_from_internet (optional bool), response_json_schema (optional object for structured output), file_urls (optional array of URLs for image/file analysis) }. Returns { success: true, result: string|object }."
    },
